["ok","% do { let {(ctxt, tc, tvs, tparms) = unLoc happy_var_2}\u000a                      ; checkTyVars tparms    -- no type pattern\u000a\u0009\u0009      ; return $\u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009  L (comb4 happy_var_1 happy_var_2 happy_var_3 happy_var_4)\u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009           -- We need the location on tycl_hdr in case \u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009\u0009   -- constrs and deriving are both empty\u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009    (mkTyData (unLoc happy_var_1) (ctxt, tc, tvs, Nothing) \u000a\u0009\u0009\u0009       Nothing (reverse (unLoc happy_var_3)) (unLoc happy_var_4)) }",[4,3,1,4,3,2,1,2]]
